Subject: [PATCH] input: keyboard: integrate H432B matrix and direct controls
Upstream-Status: Pending

Provide an independently selectable input driver for the fixed H432B key
matrix, routing buttons, direct controls and physical selectors.

---
--- a/drivers/input/keyboard/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/input/keyboard/Kconfig
@@ -14,5 +14,14 @@
 if INPUT_KEYBOARD

+config KEYBOARD_H432B
+	tristate "H432B keyboard and controls"
+	depends on GPIOLIB && OF
+	help
+	  Scan the H432B keyboard, braille routing keys, media controls and
+	  selectors. Lock and notification policies belong in userspace.
+	  Expose separate standard input devices for keys, routing and switches.
+	  Polling stops during system sleep; this driver enables no wake source.
+
 config KEYBOARD_ADC
 	tristate "ADC Ladder Buttons"
 	depends on IIO
--- a/drivers/input/keyboard/Makefile
+++ b/drivers/input/keyboard/Makefile
@@ -1,0 +2,1 @@
+obj-$(CONFIG_KEYBOARD_H432B) += h432b-input.o
